# settings-video (M12): the settings menu at real speed, for the judgment's recordings (WebKit's
# time it; Firefox is a second opinion): the panel coming out of the gear (the enter spring at its
# own pace, 643 ms, fading in over 160), Light picked (the page turning Clean Teal at once and the
# list's new content fading in over 160 ms), Dark picked (the swap back), Esc (the panel going back
# into the gear, 200 ms). Run with `tools/run act tools/states/settings-video.act --target ref
# --engines webkit` and `--target web`. Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM: the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the toggle's options 91.33 x 34 from (1113, 112).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 3000
move 760 48
video start settings
wait 400
click 1383 48
wait 1200
click 1251 129
wait 1000
click 1343 129
wait 1000
key Escape
wait 1000
video stop
